  "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: 1.6;\" didact=\"\" gothic\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" border-style:=\"\" solid;=\"\" border-color:=\"\" rgb(145,=\"\" 15,=\"\" 63);=\"\" border-width:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" border-radius:=\"\" color:=\"\" rgba(145,=\"\" 63,=\"\" 0.75);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16.8px;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.72px;\"=\"\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.3rem; text-decoration-thickness: 0.1rem; transition: text-decoration-thickness var(--duration-short) ease;\"><a href=\"https://quitepeach.com/\" style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: var(--size-body-md); box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(42, 100, 150); text-decoration-line: underline; text-decoration-thickness: 0.1rem; outline: 0px; text-underline-offset: 0.3rem; transition: text-decoration-thickness var(--duration-short) ease;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 18px;\">QuitePeach.com</span></a> is </span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">an online platform for Women's Panty & Underwear based in Belgrade Serbia, with branch offices in Germany, France and UK, and with factories in Asia and South America. As both a retailer and a wholesale distributor, </span><a href=\"https://quitepeach.com/\" style=\"box-sizing: inherit; text-underline-offset: 0.3rem; text-decoration-thickness: 0.1rem; transition: text-decoration-thickness var(--duration-short) ease;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">QuitePeach.com</span></a><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\"> aims to </span><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit;\">offer women in Europe and the whole world quality panties at wholesale prices.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: 1.6;\" didact=\"\" gothic\",=\"\" sans-serif;=\"\" border-style:=\"\" solid;=\"\" border-color:=\"\" rgb(145,=\"\" 15,=\"\" 63);=\"\" border-width:=\"\" 0px;=\"\" border-radius:=\"\" color:=\"\" rgba(145,=\"\" 63,=\"\" 0.75);=\"\" font-size:=\"\" 16.8px;=\"\" letter-spacing:=\"\" 0.72px;\"=\"\"